        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are integral to many of our customers’ card programs, pairing design and production with end-to-end offerings that are integrated within our customers’ operations and in certain cases utilize data links to transfer highly sensitive cardholder information.",
