        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are integral to many of our customers’ card programs, pairing design and production with end-to-end offerings that are integrated within our customers’ operations and require process and/or technology integration, such as secure data links to transfer highly sensitive cardholder information.",
